        "description": [
            "I remember the tempo of war. My blade meets my opponents and leaves them open to a counter.\n\n",
            "Passive Ability Unlocked: Counter\n",
            "-> Timing a counter with right-click on an opponent just before I am hit counters my attacker.\nCannot be used while wielding a shield.\n",
