            "-> Axes hook, slowing and stunning the enemy while pulling them closer for my next attack.\n",
            "-> Maces negate the attack, increasing the damage of my next hit by 100% and ignoring armor.\n",
            "-> Spears brace and knockback the opponent with a stun, granting me regen for 1 second and doubles my reach momentarily.\n",
